			</p>
		<div class="footer-seo-grid">
			<div class="footer-col">
				<h3>Top Chains</h3>
				<ul>
					<li><a href="/articles/chain/mcdonalds/">McDonald's Guides</a></li>
					<li><a href="/articles/chain/starbucks/">Starbucks Guides</a></li>
					<li><a href="/articles/chain/taco-bell/">Taco Bell Guides</a></li>
					<li><a href="/articles/chain/wendys/">Wendy's Guides</a></li>
					<li><a href="/articles/chain/chick-fil-a/">Chick-fil-A Guides</a></li>
					<li><a href="/articles/chain/subway/">Subway Guides</a></li>
				</ul>
			</div>
			<div class="footer-col">
				<h3>Top Topics</h3>
				<ul>
					<li><a href="/articles/topic/kitchen/">Kitchen Operations</a></li>
					<li><a href="/articles/topic/drive-thru/">Drive-Thru Hacks</a></li>
					<li><a href="/articles/topic/equipment/">Kitchen Equipment</a></li>
					<li><a href="/articles/topic/training/">Crew Training</a></li>
