				</ul>
			</div>
			<div class="footer-col">
				<h3>Special Features</h3>
				<ul>
					<li><a href="/secret-menus/">Secret Menus Hub</a></li>
					<li><a href="/articles/">All 100+ Guides</a></li>
					<li><a href="/about/">About Our Authors</a></li>
				</ul>
			</div>
			<div class="footer-col">
				<h3>Legal & Trust</h3>
				<ul>
					<li><a href="/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a></li>
					<li><a href="/terms/">Terms of Service</a></li>
					<li><a href="/disclaimer/">YMYL Disclaimer</a></li>
